{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Vanessa and the Customer Complaint", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "What Would You Like? ", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 2, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 2, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.3", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Exchange information about people's interests and backgrounds using a wider range of language.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Asking For and Providing Information", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you ask for information, you can use either <span class=\"strong\">WH-questions</span> or <span class=\"strong\">Yes-No questions</span> depending on what information you ask for.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "When you provide information, you give facts. You may do this with with future tenses: <span class=\"italic\">will, going to, the Present Continuous</span> or <span class=\"italic\">the Present Simple</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Asking for Information\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Providing Information\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Can you show me my table?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Sure. It's at the back of the restaurant.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Is it an important meeting?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Yes. We're meeting a new employee today.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"How late does the kitchen serve?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"The kitchen serves until 11:00 p.m.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Won't he help me?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"He'll help you when she arrives.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Is it a Mr. Brown?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Melinda</span>: Yes. We're meeting here. We'll eat, then, I'm leaving.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Oh. Do you need to go somewhere else?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Melinda</span>: No. I'm breaking up with him.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  Won't he be upset?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Melinda</span>: He'll get over it.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: How late do you serve?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Melinda</span>: The kitchen serves until midnight all week.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Making Polite Requests", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you make polite requests in a work environment, you can use the modals <span class=\"italic\">could</span> and <span class=\"italic\">would</span>.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You use these phrases to make requests:<br/><ul> \t<li>Could you + base form of the verb ... ?</li> \t<li>Would you + base form of the verb ... ?</li> \t </ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Customer</span>: Could you make sure our dinner comes quickly?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Waiter</span>: Certainly. I can do that.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Customer</span>: Would you also make sure the wine keeps coming?<br/>  <span class=\"strong\">Waiter</span>: Of course, Miss.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Customer</span>: Would you please bill me for the second bottle and a very elaborate second dessert?<br/>  <span class=\"strong\">Waiter</span>: I'll take care of that right away.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Waiter</span>: Would you sign here please? <br/><span class=\"strong\">Customer</span>: Of course.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "credit card", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a card to use in place of cash", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Please use my credit card to bill me for dinner. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le02ob02aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about food in a restaurant.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "trifle", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a dessert made with custard, fruit and whipping cream", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We have an excellent trifle for dessert tonight.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le02ob02aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "mousse", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a light dessert made with eggs and cream", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: This is a chocolate mousse and this is a strawberry mousse.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le02ob02aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "tiramisu", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a dessert made with soft cheese and coffee", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The tiramisu is made with a traditional Italian recipe.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le02ob02aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "darling", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a term of endearment", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Thank you so much Edmund, darling.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le02ob02aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "baked potato", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a potato cooked whole in the oven", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Can we have a baked potato with our steak please?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le02ob02aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn8le02ob02re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Write a sho