n>: No. I'm going to break up with him. My train home leaves at 11:30. I want to be on it.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn8le02ob02re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Won't he be upset?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Melinda</span>: He'll get over it. How late do you serve?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: The kitchen serves until midnight all week.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Melinda</span>: Hmmm. Could you make sure our dinner comes quickly?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Certainly. I can do that.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Melinda</span>: Would you also make sure the wine keeps coming? I'd like him as happy as possible. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Of course, Miss.", "id": 2, "time": "20200", "image": "engenn8le02ob02re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Melinda</span>: Here's my credit card. Will you please bill me for the second bottle and a very elaborate second dessert? He'll want trifle or mousse or tiramisu. He's going to want to eat more after I tell him.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Thanks. Now I'll take you over to Mr. Brown.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Melinda</span>: Are you staying and taking our order as well?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'd be happy to do that. Come this way please.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Melinda</span>: Edmund darling. Miss?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: What can I do for you?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Melinda</span>: We'll have two large steaks with baked potatoes and a large caesar salad to start please.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'll take care of that right away. Would you sign here please?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Melinda</span>: Of course.", "id": 3, "time": "38000", "image": "engenn8le02ob02re2img01.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn8le02ob02re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn8le02ob02re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}